      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p><details><summary>See rules...</summary>\n<p><p>This monster doesn't have a single mind (typically because it's a swarm of smaller creatures), and is immune to mental effects that target only a specific number of creatures. It is still subject to mental effects that affect all creatures in an area.</p></p></details></p>",
