    {
      "name": "Painful Devouring",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>Each enemy in the swarm's space takes 8d6 Acid Damage damage (Basic DC 38 Reflex Saving Throw save). Creatures that fail this save become Slowed 1 from the swarm's painful bites. On a critical failure, the painful bites cause the creature to become Slowed 2. In either case, the slowed condition persists for 1 round.</p>",
